OL,3,GNEWSAI scaled up my garage home cinema
OL,4,Ato a 470-seat movie theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor as long as Tristan Campbell can
OL,7,Fremember, he has loved the movies.
OL,9,FHe has a home cinema in his garage in
OL,10,FElgin but, over the past few years, he
OL,11,Fhas embarked on a project which will
OL,12,Fsee him "scale it up a bit".
OL,14,FIn the very near future, he hopes to
OL,15,Freopen the 470-seater former Odeon in
OL,16,FDumfries, a venue that closed its doors
OL,17,Fin 2018, leaving the town without a
OL,18,Flarge-scale cinema.
OL,20,FAs side hustles go, they do not come
OL,21,Fmuch more ambitious than this.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
